  "source_issues": [
    "Table3 sulfur conversion is 100*residue sulfate-S/residue sulfide-S, not starting-feed conversion. Sulfate medium and other sulfides prevent galena-specific sulfur attribution.",
    "Control96h2.70/16.10*100=16.77 but printed18.05; control192h2.72/15.07*100=18.05 but printed16.73. No silent correction adopted.",
    "288h47.99/27.25=1.76 rather than exactlytwofold;384h49.78 differs from prose unchanged.",
    "NominalpH2/FeII2.0gL differ from Table2 initial2.2/2.159gL; inoculum-volume denominator unresolved.",
    "Approximate starting phase values total101%; residue phase estimates lack uncertainty and residue mass.",
    "Inoculated and sterile-labelled controls have unlike pH/redox; no detailed sterility/replicate/uncertainty data. SyntheticPbS comparator has pH rise and poor activity.",
    "No accepted isolated-product yield, lead-in-solution advantage, criticality inheritance or industrial deployment."
  ],
